        "description": {
          "value": "<p data-visibility=\"gm\"><strong>Trigger</strong> The yeti is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} while not in combat, and a creature would observe it.</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The yeti Strides or Climbs up to half its Speed to a location where it can @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hide}, then Hides. If its new Stealth check result meets or exceeds the triggering creature's Perception DC, the yeti remains hidden.</p>"
