    {
      "_id": "ETKiuTyiRlxOvslV",
      "name": "Second Wind",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 700000,
      "flags": {},
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.feat-effects.z3uyCMBddrPK5umr]{Effect: Rage}</p>\n<p>You can enter a second @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Ah5g9pDwWF9b9VW9]{Rage}, but afterward you need to catch your breath. You can Rage without waiting for 1 minute after the previous Rage (or 1 round, with quick rage), but when you end this second Rage, you're @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued} until you rest for 10 minutes.</p>"
        },
        "source": {
          "value": ""
        },
